# the polysys-speed investigation (3D Golf / POLYSYS loads tiles then LODSWs TCR
# masks). Before the decode.sv fix the read went out ahead of the 4th OUT 7Eh
# and ~half the TCR answers used the previous tile. Replayed by tools/ops2prog.py
